      "evidence": "app.get('/fetch-data', ...)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The endpoint is a proxy that can be abused to perform distributed scanning or resource exhaustion attacks if not rate-limited.",
      "suggested_fix": "Implement express-rate-limit middleware to restrict the number of requests per IP."
